<!--
    MSI Thin GF63 12HW  (board MS-16R7, BIOS E16R7IMS.10F, EC 16R7IMS1.104)

    The "Default" profiles below were READ BACK FROM THIS LAPTOP'S OWN EC
    via the MSI_ACPI WMI2 interface (Get_Temperature / Get_Fan / Get_Thermal,
    subVal 1 = CPU, 2 = GPU) on 2026-09-13. They are not copied from another
    model and not hand-invented - they are exactly what the EC shipped with.

    Measured raw responses (WMI version 2.8):
      CPU  Get_Temperature(1): 01 00 58 64 37 40 49 4C 52
           Get_Fan(1)        : 01 2B 26 2B 30 36 3C 46 55
           Get_Thermal(1)    : 01 5F 08 03 03 03 03 03 00
      GPU  Get_Temperature(2): 01 00 55 63 37 3D 43 49 4F
           Get_Fan(2)        : 01 2B 26 2B 30 36 3C 46 55
           Get_Thermal(2)    : 01 5F 08 03 03 03 03 03 00

    Get_Thermal returns DOWN-THRESHOLD OFFSETS on this EC, so OffsetDT is
    true: Tdown = Tup - offset.

    NOTE: this machine has ONE physical fan. Get_Fan(0) reports a single
    tachometer (fan[0]); fan[1..3] read zero. The EC still keeps separate
    CPU and GPU threshold tables and drives the fan from whichever demands
    more, so both tables below are still meaningful.
-->
